  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Banner of Foolish Bravery\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Banner-of-the-foolish-bravery.png\" title=\"Image:Banner-of-the-foolish-bravery.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Banner-of-the-foolish-bravery.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Banner-of-the-foolish-bravery.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Passive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Warrior\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Increases Fear Resistance\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>You carry a banner in your pocket that inspires you to ignore the most primitive part of your brain.  You know the part that tells you to be fearful in certain '100% you're gonna die' situation. Your only options are to fight or fight MORE! There is no fight or flight. Thus, when you carry this pocket-sized banner in your skill tray it will passively increase your Fear Resistance.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>...will passively increase your Fear Resistance by X %.</b>\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 25\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 70\n</td><td> 85\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X\n</td><td> 35\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 65\n</td><td> 75\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 91895\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
